Desktop icons
=============

The .svg files in this directory are Material Symbols (Rounded, filled,
48px) by Google, https://fonts.google.com/icons, licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The .icn files are generated from them by mk/gen_icons.py (alpha masks,
96x96, tinted by the desktop at draw time). Regenerate with:

    python3 mk/gen_icons.py

Mapping (desktop entry -> Material Symbol):
  terminal    terminal            calc        calculate
  calendar    calendar_month      clock       schedule
  files       folder              disks       hard_drive
  devmgr      developer_board     hexedit     data_object
  install     install_desktop     logview     receipt_long
  monitor     speed               notepad     edit_note
  puzzle15    extension           2048        grid_view
  settings    settings            tetris      sports_esports
  pl          code                desktop-rs  desktop_windows
